      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is zero free like Forage?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes. Both are free for students. Forage is funded by the companies that sponsor simulations. zero is funded by the recruiters who hire from it, which is why your scored work doubles as a way to get found.</div></div>
